---

This repository vendors the following third-party code, each with its upstream
license preserved in place:

  - lib/forge-std          — foundry-rs/forge-std (MIT/Apache-2.0)
  - test/vendor/ZKNOX_*.sol — ZKNoxHQ/ETHDILITHIUM (MIT), used as differential
                              test oracles only
  - test/ZZZ_LibKeccak_OP.sol — ethereum-optimism/lib-keccak (MIT), used as a
                              Keccak cross-check oracle only
  - pythonref/dilithium_py — GiacomoPope/dilithium-py (MIT), the off-chain
                              reference implementation used by ffi tests

It also redistributes third-party TEST DATA. Each corpus is stored with a
`provenance` file beside it recording the upstream URL, retrieval date and
SHA-256; none of it is part of the deployable software:

  - test/vectors/wycheproof/mldsa_44_verify_test.json
                            — C2SP/wycheproof, stored byte-for-byte.
                              Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
                              http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
                              Unmodified; see the upstream NOTICE and LICENSE
                              in the C2SP/wycheproof repository.
  - tools/fixtures/acvp_data/mldsa44.json, shake256.json
    formal/acvp/data/mldsa_keygen.json
                            — distilled from usnistgov/ACVP-Server test
                              projections; see that repository for its terms.
  - pythonref/assets/PQCsignKAT_Dilithium2.rsp
                            — NIST "PQCsignKAT" *format* only. Not a NIST
                              artefact and carrying no NIST authority; the
                              keys and signatures were generated locally.
                              See pythonref/assets/provenance.txt.
